<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the German</p>
<p>league championship after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>18 - Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart), Ulf Kirsten (Bayer</p>
<p>Leverkusen)</p>
<p>17 - Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich), Giovane Elber (VfB</p>
<p>Stuttgart)</p>
<p>16 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>15 - Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen), Toni Polster (Cologne)</p>
<p>14 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen)</p>
<p>13 - Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock), Krasimir Balakov (VfB</p>
<p>Stuttgart), Juergen Klinsmann (Bayern Munich).</p>
</text>
